  "title": "Mushroom Spinach Gnocchi with Creamy Boursin Sauce",
  "description": "These mushroom spinach gnocchi are ready in 15 minutes. Paired with a creamy Boursin sauce, this is a delicious meatless dinner for weekdays.",
  "authors": [
    "thedailygourmet"
